			"notes": "Compatibility and stability update focused on a crash reported in Cobblemon environments with Sinytra Connector, in NeoForge\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Fixed `Duplicate id value` crashes when Pokémon entities were created.\n- Removed WildBosses' custom `SynchedEntityData` entries from Cobblemon's `PokemonEntity`.\n- Boss state now uses WildBosses' existing registry, entity tags, persistent NBT, and scoreboard teams.\n- Improved compatibility with other mods that also modify `PokemonEntity` or its parent entity classes.\n- Improved compatibility when running the Fabric build through Sinytra Connector on NeoForge.\n\nThe crash was reported with different conflicting IDs, including `17` and `21`, depending on the installed mods and load order.\n\n### Cobblemon 1.7.3\nA separate compatibility build is also available for Cobblemon 1.7.3.\n\n## Notes\n\nWildBosses is still officially developed for Fabric.\n\nSinytra Connector / NeoForge **is not an officially supported environment,** but this update removes the WildBosses behavior that was contributing to the reported entity data collisions."
